    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYDLESS is a fast-paced FPS built around momentum, skill, and a deadly bouncing ball, the more you punch it, the faster it gets\u2014turning it into a high-speed, projectile of destruction. It fuses together classic movement shooters with a unique bouncing ball weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/f4909629260108ac1c83bc1cfe4ada10.poster.avif?t=1749589014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/f4909629260108ac1c83bc1cfe4ada10.webm?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/f4909629260108ac1c83bc1cfe4ada10.mp4?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality is breaking. Trapped in an anomaly, you are Diego, an employee of Rundy\u2019s Burger, a  fast-food chain at the end of the \u201890s. But something is wrong. The restaurant keeps shifting, twisting into increasingly distorted versions of itself.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.poster.avif?t=1749589014\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.webm?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/e1d4dd86ce81e79061e2c60986140423.mp4?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your agility and mastery of movement to navigate the chaos and avoid relentless attacks from the  customers, twisted by the shifting reality of the restaurant.Destroy them with your only weapon\u2014a high-speed bouncing ball that gains more power the faster it moves. Punch it, control it and Turn every room into a deadly playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through four chapters, each unlocking new powers to push your abilities even further. Every level features a ranking system based on speed and skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/40ffe8bd8097a06b9f2182f47206ef62.poster.avif?t=1749589014\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/40ffe8bd8097a06b9f2182f47206ef62.webm?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/40ffe8bd8097a06b9f2182f47206ef62.mp4?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master each stage, and push your skills to the limit as you fight to escape the loop\u2026 if escape is even possible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.poster.avif?t=1749589014\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.webm?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524780/extras/ef156377b4f1278d92f87b44b8437c7d.mp4?t=1749589014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
